This file lists the third-party work Aether-Kit contains or derives from. Each
entry names the files that carry it.

Hugging Face Diffusers (https://github.com/huggingface/diffusers, commit
2a1433913c7044f34fa4767dd84b28bba0bb0ecf, tag v0.42.1), Apache License 2.0,
copyright Krea AI and The HuggingFace Team. Forge/krea2/krea2_graphs.py
re-expresses Krea2Transformer2DModel, Krea2Pipeline's prompt and latent
packing, and AutoencoderKLQwenImage's single-frame decode as export graphs;
the realism adapter's key mapping is Diffusers' own Krea 2 converter, called
at export time. Forge/sdturbo/sdturbo_graphs.py wraps UNet2DConditionModel and
AutoencoderKL's decode as export graphs, and
Sources/AetherRuntime/Generative/EpsilonEulerSchedule.swift re-expresses
EulerDiscreteScheduler's input scaling and epsilon step. Forge/flux2/flux2_graphs.py
re-expresses Flux2Transformer2DModel, Flux2KleinPipeline's prompt encoding, latent
packing and empirical shift, and AutoencoderKLFlux2's decode and encode tails.
Forge/h3/h3_graphs.py and export_h3.py re-express MiniMaxH3Transformer3DModel's
block, heads, text refiner and input projections, the MiniMax H3 scheduler's
step grid, AutoencoderKLMiniMaxH3's window decode and tiled first-frame
encode (encode_vae_condition), and AutoencoderKLMiniMaxH3Audio's decode as
export graphs; the checkpoint key mapping is Diffusers' own MiniMax H3
converter, called at export time.
Model weights are not part of this repository; exported bundles carry their own
licenses and NOTICE lines separately (the Krea 2 Community License; the
Stability AI Community License; FLUX.2 [klein]'s Apache-2.0 LICENSE.md with a
modification NOTICE; the MiniMax H3 Community License).

Depth Anything 3 (https://github.com/ByteDance-Seed/Depth-Anything-3, commit
3d835ec1a5802d64a8b8b15f817a1ab54809bfe4), Apache License 2.0, copyright
ByteDance Seed; it includes DINOv2 vision transformer code, Apache License 2.0,
copyright (c) Meta Platforms, Inc. and affiliates. Forge/depth/depth_graphs.py
wraps DepthAnything3Net's single-view depth path (the DINOv2 backbone and the
DualDPT head, with ImageNet normalization folded in) as an export graph and
re-expresses its 2D rotary position embedding with a static table; the
upstream code is fetched unmodified by Forge/depth/fetch_upstream.py. The
depth-anything/DA3-SMALL weights are not part of this repository; the
exported bundle carries their Apache-2.0 license and a modification NOTICE.

OpenAI CLIP (https://github.com/openai/CLIP), MIT License, copyright (c) 2021
OpenAI. Sources/AetherImage/CLIPTokenizer.swift re-expresses its byte-level BPE
tokenizer: the pre-tokenization pattern, the byte-to-unicode table and the
end-of-word merge rule.

kokoro (https://github.com/hexgrad/kokoro, version 0.9.4), Apache License 2.0,
copyright hexgrad. Forge/kokoro/kokoro_graphs.py re-expresses its KModel
(the ALBERT duration predictor, prosody predictor and iSTFTNet decoder,
including SineGen's harmonic source) as export graphs; the unmodified package
is fetched by Forge/kokoro/fetch_upstream.py and read only as the reference.
Kokoro-82M weights and voices are not part of this repository; the exported
bundle carries their Apache-2.0 license and a modification NOTICE.

Hugging Face Transformers (https://github.com/huggingface/transformers,
